      "title": "Request query string run through eval",
      "description": "The /calc handler passes req.query.expr straight to eval. The added comments switch off the linters that would report this. Any caller can run arbitrary JavaScript on the server, such as require('child_process').execSync(...). That gives full remote code execution. Remove eval and parse the expression with a restricted arithmetic evaluator such as expr-eval. Reject any input that fails to parse.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "semgrep:openqodex.suppression-added",
